misl overlay: desktop (alpha)

Base (from 09-config, not this overlay):
  /etc/systemd/network/20-dhcp.network  wired DHCP on en* eth*
  systemd-networkd, systemd-resolved, systemd-timesyncd enabled
  /etc/vconsole.conf  KEYMAP=$MISL_KEYMAP (default us)

This overlay adds:
  /etc/systemd/network/30-wireless.network  DHCP on wl*, metric 600
  /etc/systemd/system/timers.target.wants/fstrim.timer  weekly TRIM (enabled by apply.sh)

Wi-Fi:
  install -m600 wpa_supplicant-IFACE.conf.example \
    /etc/wpa_supplicant/wpa_supplicant-$(ls /sys/class/net | grep ^wl).conf
  edit ssid/psk, then systemctl enable --now wpa_supplicant@<iface>
  networkctl status <iface>; resolvectl status

Undo: misl overlay undo desktop (children first) removes exactly these.
